      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The time-dependent characteristics and ethological features of intraspecies fighting-induced analgesia were demonstrated in experiments on dominant and submissive-defeated mice. Opiate but not GABAergic mechanisms were found to be involved in fighting-induced analgesia in submissive-defeated mice."},
